OL,3,GNEWSABabydoll singer says life will
OL,4,A'never be the same again' after UK
OL,5,Anumber one
OL,6,
OL,7,FJamie Miller says "nothing feels
OL,8,Fnormal" anymore but he is trying to
OL,9,F"live in the moment" as he comes to
OL,10,Fterms with his history-making song
OL,11,FBabydoll.
OL,13,FLast week the 29-year-old became the
OL,14,Ffirst Welsh artist to top the UK
OL,15,Fsingles chart in 15 years with the
OL,16,Fviral TikTok hit.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
