OL,3,GNEWSABabydoll singer says life will
OL,4,A'never be the same again' after UK
OL,5,Anumber one
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe singer, who is originally from
OL,8,FPontprennau in Cardiff, said his dreams
OL,9,Fhad "come true" and life would "never
OL,10,Fbe the same again" after a challenging
OL,11,Ffew years in which he even had to give
OL,12,Fup on music for a time.
OL,14,FMiller said the last year had been
OL,15,F"insane" as he has gone from watching
OL,16,FGavin and Stacey with his parents to
OL,17,Fgetting messages on his social media
OL,18,Ffrom the cast.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
